From 0f77d0221b8969323f6d1bb96b5da5fb59e11a93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evgeniy Yelagin <evgeniy@kolibr.io>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 18:34:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add TPU transaction proxy for forwarding non-vote
 transactions via UDP

Two independent proxy instances capture all non-vote transaction traffic:
- Port 8009 (TPU QUIC) via FetchStageManager
- Port 8010 (TPU Forward QUIC) via FetchStage

Each proxied UDP datagram contains raw transaction bytes + 32-byte
validator identity pubkey. Supports multiple targets, hostnames,
and hot-reload via admin RPC (set-tpu-proxy-addresses).

